# React / Inertia

- TypeScript strict; avoid `any` unless justified at a boundary.
- Use existing Inertia patterns and generated Wayfinder routes/actions.
- Generated Wayfinder output is not committed; canonical quality generation handles it.
- User-facing text is Russian only.
- Never treat frontend visibility as authorization.
- Never expose secrets or full Eloquent models unnecessarily through props.
- Prefer small cohesive components and existing shadcn primitives.
- Preserve loading, disabled, empty and error states where the flow needs them.
- Do not add another state/router/form framework without an approved need.
